7954	What are variables in email message text?		11.3.2
7955	<em>Variables</em> are short text strings, enclosed in square brackets [], that you can insert into configured email message text. When an individual message is generated, data from your site is substituted for the variables. Some commonly-used variables are:		11.3.2
7956	[site:login-url]: The URL where users can log in to your site.		11.3.2
7957	[user:display-name]: The user's displayed name.		11.3.2
